      "id": "ivanhoe-source-6-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-6",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Cedric’s hall",
      "description": "Waits impatiently for supper in the chair on the dais and rebuffs Balder’s attempt to claim his attention. Puts his head against Cedric’s knee and noses his hand before being ordered down.",
