      "id": "ivanhoe-source-6-p23",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-6",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Preparing for the guests",
      "description": "Asks about the Prior’s family, recalls the displaced Saxon household and asks the Templar’s name. Assents to the Prior’s family connection and answers with Brian de Bois-Guilbert’s name. Hears Cedric’s questions about the Prior and the Templar. Leaves with several household attendants to carry out Cedric’s hospitality orders.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-rotherwood-hall",
