      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-6",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Instructions for Elgitha",
      "description": "Orders the best drinks and tells Elgitha that Rowena need not attend unless she wishes. Receives Cedric’s instructions to broach the oldest wine and prepare the household’s drinks. Is addressed by name and answers that Rowena wants the latest news from Palestine.",
