      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The disowned son",
      "description": "Dismisses Elgitha and declares that he will not enquire after the son who disobeyed him. Remains available to the master after Elgitha carries the message away. Leaves the hall after Cedric directs her to carry his message to Rowena.",
