      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The doors open",
      "description": "Looks up as the hall doors open for the evening’s guests. Leads the guests into the hall with his wand before four torch-bearing domestics. Enters the hall with the visiting party. Enters Cedric’s hall among the evening’s guests. Follows the visitors into the hall. Enters with the guests’ retinue behind the steward and torchbearers.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-rotherwood-hall",
