      "id": "ivanhoe-source-9-p6",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-9",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A summons in the antechamber",
      "description": "Obeys a waiting-maid’s invitation to speak with Rowena. Yields his torch and waits in the antechamber. Takes Anwold’s torch and conducts the Palmer to Rowena.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-rotherwood-antechamber",
