      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-9-p7",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-9",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Seven steps to the chamber",
      "description": "Leads the Palmer up the seven oak steps into Rowena’s apartment with Anwold’s torch; her name has not yet been spoken. Enters Rowena’s raised apartment and bows before her. Receives the Palmer and asks her attendants to withdraw, except Elgitha. Is specifically retained beside Rowena for the private conversation.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-rotherwood-rowena-chamber",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
