      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-9-p17",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-9",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The sleeping cup",
      "description": "Is among the maidens recalled by Rowena before the Palmer’s departure; the source does not identify which maiden carries the cup. Ends the questions, summons the maidens and offers the Palmer a piece of gold. Tastes the spiced wine and receives Rowena’s offer of gold. Is among Rowena’s attendants when they are recalled.",
