      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Gurth awakened",
      "description": "Enters the next cell with Isaac and orders Gurth to open the postern. Raises himself on his pallet and resents the Palmer’s commanding familiarity. Follows the Palmer to obtain a way out of Rotherwood.",
