      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A private word",
      "description": "Enters with a joke about Isaac leaving with the Palmer. First refuses an early departure, then springs up when the Palmer whispers to him. Whispers privately in Saxon and cautions Gurth before repeating the order to open the gate. Witnesses Gurth’s unexpected compliance.",
