      "id": "ivanhoe-source-9-p49",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-9",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Outside the postern",
      "description": "Calls urgently for his mule when the postern is opened. Asks Gurth to fetch a second mule and promises to return it to Cedric’s train at Ashby. Agrees to the private instruction and departs to fetch the requested animals; the source does not establish where he goes. Follows through the postern with Isaac, wondering at Gurth’s changed demeanour.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-rotherwood-postern",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
