      "id": "ivanhoe-source-10-p49",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-10",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A handful of gold",
      "description": "Is beside her father in the lower spectators’ space as the mounted prince takes his pouch and rides on. Seizes Isaac’s pouch, throws two gold coins to Wamba and rides onward. Fumbles unwillingly for the demanded coins before John takes the whole pouch. Receives two gold pieces from John.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-ashby-lower-ring",
