      "id": "ivanhoe-source-11-p24",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-11",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The challengers prevail",
      "description": "Overthrows his first opponent and retains his seat through successive challenges. Unhorses an opponent and remains undefeated through the successive entries. Wins his bouts while the challengers maintain their advantage. Receives a foul crossing blow from an opponent and remains undefeated. Breaks evenly with his first opponent and retains his seat in the subsequent entries.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-ashby-lists",
