      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "An unwilling champion",
      "description": "Talks to his attendants about preparing the banquet and awarding the prize to Brian while no new opponent comes forward. Urges Athelstane to take the lance against the successful challengers. Declines to arm for the day and promises to enter the melee tomorrow. Makes a double-edged compliment which Athelstane accepts and Cedric resents.",
