      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The day’s award",
      "description": "Joins the unanimous award of the first day’s honours after the stranger defeats the final challenger. Concurs with the prince and the other marshal in declaring the stranger the day’s victor. Unhorses Vipont and is unanimously awarded the day’s honours. Is thrown violently, bleeds from nose and mouth and is carried away unconscious. Joins the marshals in awarding the day to the stranger.",
