      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The closed visor",
      "description": "Receives the marshals’ report that the victor wishes to remain unknown before they request permission to present him. Politely refuses to reveal his face when the marshals congratulate him. Accepts the stranger’s explanation and seeks permission to present him. Joins in escort arrangements while respecting the knight’s incognito.",
