      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The prize horse",
      "description": "Conducts the victor to the wooden steps below John’s throne for the presentation of the prize horse. Accompanies the victor’s approach to the foot of the throne steps, respecting his closed visor. Delivers the warhorse with an embarrassed compliment. Acknowledges the award silently, mounts the prize horse and displays its paces around the lists.",
