      "title": "The coronet on the lance",
      "description": "Whispers to John that the victor must select the Queen of Beauty and Love. Recommends Alicia, places the green-satin coronet upon the lance and orders it raised. Turns to John’s throne, lowers his lance for the coronet and raises it at the prince’s command.",
