      "id": "ivanhoe-source-12-p32",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-12",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Rowena chosen",
      "description": "Lowers the lance to deposit the coronet at Rowena’s feet. Is acclaimed Queen of Beauty and Love for tomorrow. Gives generously to the heralds in his joy at the selection. Adds an equally large donation after Cedric.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-ashby-saxon-gallery",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
        "ivanhoe-character-disinherited",
