      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The private attendant",
      "description": "Refuses curious pages, allows only his own attendant to disarm him and eats food brought to him. Keeps his face hidden under a Norman bonnet while removing the knight’s armour and serving food.",
