      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p11",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "An unended quarrel",
      "description": "Refuses Brian’s ransom and arms, then grants Baldwin the forfeited equipment if Brian will not reclaim it. Defends his master’s honour and leaves with the other squires after receiving the equipment back.",
