      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Gurth’s reward",
      "description": "Praises the day’s outcome and gives Gurth ten gold pieces for his risky service. Is identified as the concealed squire, discusses the danger of discovery and pockets ten gold pieces.",
