      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p40",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The veiled daughter",
      "description": "Orders Rebecca to veil herself and admits the visitor before learning why he has come. Drops a silver-gauze veil over her face before Gurth enters. Arrives disguised, withholds his name and verifies Isaac’s identity before paying.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-ashby-host-house-upper-room",
