      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p66",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A summons below",
      "description": "Descends the stairs, fears the white-clad figure, then recognises Rebecca and explains the payment. Uses a silver lamp to guide Gurth into a side room and asks what he paid.",
