      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p70",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Rebecca’s purse",
      "description": "Gives Gurth one hundred coins, ordering him to restore his master’s due, keep the remainder and leave without thanks, then summons Reuben to light him out. Receives the purse and instructions to repay his master and keep the surplus.",
