      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Reuben lights the way out",
      "description": "Opens the outer door, guides Gurth across the paved court, lets him through the wicket and secures it with bolts and chains. Follows the torch across the court and passes outside through the wicket.",
