      "id": "ivanhoe-source-13-p71",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-13",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A hope of freedom",
      "description": "Counts his ten-coin reward and twenty-coin surplus, imagining the freedom another such gain could buy.",
