      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The chosen sides",
      "description": "Arrives with his retinue and favours the original challengers. Arrives with Rowena, disapproving of Athelstane’s chosen side. Comes to exercise the honour awarded her yesterday. Arms for Brian’s party, privately resentful of the rival who selected Rowena. Joins the challengers’ side at John’s hint.",
