      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The general onset",
      "description": "Withdraws from the lists with the other marshal after checking the numbers, clearing the ground before the charge. Pronounces the release signal after the counts are complete. Charges with his party and repeatedly tries to reach Brian through the crowded fight. Leads his own onset and seeks his rival amid the combat.",
