      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Three against one",
      "description": "Meets Brian, then evades a converging assault by Athelstane and Front-de-Bœuf using the prize horse’s agility. Joins the pursuit with a horse already bleeding from its wound. Turns from his flank to attack the stranger in concert with Brian. Adds his strength to the three-sided attack. Refuses appeals to end the unequal encounter.",
