      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Desdichado to the rescue",
      "description": "Spurs his fresh horse into the unequal fight and strikes Front-de-Bœuf before the baron’s raised sword can fall. Rolls to the ground with his horse, both stunned by the blow that glances from his helmet onto the chamfron. Is pressing the Templar while Front-de-Bœuf approaches with his sword raised. Faces the Disinherited Knight as the black-armoured rider intervenes.",
