      "id": "ivanhoe-source-15-p41",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-15",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The award confirmed",
      "description": "Is conducted through the damaged field to the foot of John’s throne and bows at the award. Helps escort the exhausted victor to the prince’s throne. Shares the escort through the bloodied field. Confirms the tournament award and announces the victor’s right to receive the chaplet.",
