      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-15",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Across the field",
      "description": "Is conducted across the lists to the foot of Rowena’s throne amid the acclamations. Escorts the victor from the prince’s side to the Queen’s throne. Shares the escort across the lists to the western seat of honour.",
