      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A reluctant kneeling",
      "description": "Totters and is made to kneel, weakly protesting removal of his helmet. Descends with the chaplet to crown the kneeling knight. Insists the champion’s head must be bare. Joins in demanding the ceremonial unhelming.",
