      "description": "Describes Rowena’s wealth and birth to John. Proposes marrying Rowena to a Norman and orders De Bigot to summon the Saxon party to the banquet. Accepts the prospect of Rowena and her lands as a reward. Receives instructions to phrase the renewed invitation courteously.",
