      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Hubert’s first trial",
      "description": "Places two arrows within the inner ring and wins the original eight-man contest. Orders Locksley to compete against Hubert and offers a further reward. Accepts a two-shaft trial if Hubert must then shoot at a mark of his choosing.",
