      "title": "The bowstring changed",
      "description": "Replaces a frayed string, splits the willow, refuses John’s service and gives the twenty nobles to Hubert. Awards the horn and twenty nobles, offering fifty for bodyguard service. Accepts Locksley’s gift reluctantly after acknowledging the superior marksmanship.",
