      "id": "ivanhoe-source-17-p7",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-17",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Saxon guests",
      "description": "Attends in Saxon dress and explains Rowena’s absence by indisposition. Attends beside Cedric and consumes the rich pie without knowing its fashionable ingredients. Receives the Saxons courteously while sharing private amusement with Fitzurse. Hears John take credit for not laughing at his visitors’ appearance.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-ashby-castle-hall",
