      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Faces uncovered",
      "description": "Removes helmet and most armour, showing yellow curls and blue eyes, then questions how his host thrives on pease. Throws back his cowl, reveals a black beard and vigorous frame and serves fountain water.",
