      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The missing patient",
      "description": "Searches unsuccessfully for Ivanhoe, recognises and secures Gurth, then learns of a lady’s litter from bystanders. Searches openly in distress for his vanished master and is taken as a fugitive.",
