      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Saint Withold’s hospitality",
      "description": "Reaches the convent and accepts its lengthy hospitality before leaving after breakfast. Shares the Saxon abbot’s supper and next morning’s meal. Receives the Saxon nobles with generous hospitality.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-st-withold-convent",
