      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Unwelcome reminders",
      "description": "Interrupts Rowena’s conversation and is displeased by reminders of Athelstane’s fall. Discusses Ivanhoe’s gallantry and fate with her attendant. Defends Rowena’s conversation by recalling Athelstane’s overthrow.",
