      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-22",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The chiefs taken",
      "description": "Pins one attacker with his remaining javelin, strikes a branch with his sword and is disarmed and dragged from his horse. Is pulled down before he can draw a weapon. Is taken with the party’s central group. Is captured at the rear beside Rebecca. Shares the rear group’s capture.",
