      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A familiar voice",
      "description": "Meets Gurth and Fangs, reports the capture and hears Gurth resolve to rescue Cedric. Asks what happened and abandons his refusal of service when Cedric is in danger. Jumps up to greet Wamba after finding Gurth.",
