      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The horn left behind",
      "description": "Stops the pair, gives Wamba his horn, baldric and cap feather, dons a mask and goes to reconnoitre. Recognises the prize horn’s owner and receives the conspicuous belongings. Is ordered to wait while the yeoman investigates.",
