      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-22",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "More hands needed",
      "description": "Returns with reconnaissance and rejects a three-man assault on disciplined sentries. Hears that rescuing Cedric requires a larger force. Waits with the borrowed horn and hears that the captives face no immediate violence.",
