      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Following through the wood",
      "description": "Leads the pair through the wood at a fast pace. Follows the yeoman in search of more rescuers. Follows while inspecting the baldric and horn he still carries and recalling their prize.",
