      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A voice remembered",
      "description": "Recognises the yeoman’s voice from a recent night encounter and tells Wamba not to offend him. Declines to explain his names or movements by night while promising aid. Whispers his alarm at being in the stranger’s power.",
