      "id": "ivanhoe-source-23-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-23",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The gathering oak",
      "description": "Is recognised by armed sentries, asks after the Miller, the absent minstrel and the friar, and orders a daybreak muster and scouts toward Torquilstone. Arrives after three hours’ walking and sees the respect given to his guide. Accompanies Locksley to the gathering tree.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-forest-rendezvous-oak",
