      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Singing beyond the door",
      "description": "Leads the pair to the hermitage and knocks repeatedly. Adds flourishes to the drinking chorus and remarks on its unlikely source. Identifies the Clerk’s reputation for taking deer.",
