      "title": "The visitors admitted",
      "description": "Enters with Wamba and Gurth, challenges the unknown guest and tells the friar a fighting muster is needed. Pretends to know the guest as Sir Anthony of Scrabelstone. Defends his host while admitting he would have compelled shelter. Enters with the rescuers. Is admitted after waiting at the door.",
