      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Rivals among the captors",
      "description": "Refuses to leave for his pretended rescue and insists he will reveal himself to Rowena at the castle. Discloses his desire for Rebecca and his agreement to share Isaac’s spoils with Front-de-Bœuf.",
