      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-24",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Across the drawbridge",
      "description": "Sounds three horn blasts for the bridge to be lowered. Is forced to dismount and taken with Athelstane toward separate confinement. Tries to eat the hasty repast before being removed.",
