      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A table brought in",
      "description": "Demands a ransom term from the masked serving officer and applauds Athelstane’s challenge. Eats, issues a challenge to Front-de-Bœuf after liberation and complains about the garlic.",
