      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-25-p7",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-25",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The scales",
      "description": "Has waited nearly three hours when Front-de-Bœuf and two attendants enter. Locks the dungeon and has scales and weights laid before his prisoner. Enters the dungeon with Abdalla carrying one of the two baskets; waits back while one of the pair lays out scales and weights. Enters the dungeon with Hamet carrying one of the two baskets; waits back while one of the pair lays out scales and weights.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-dungeon",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
        "ivanhoe-character-isaac",
