      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "No inward bar",
      "description": "Leaves the cell, locks the door and descends the steep turret stair; her next room is not stated. Is locked in alone and finds no secret exit or inner door bolt, only a window onto an isolated bartisan.",
