      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Ornaments offered",
      "description": "Unclasps two bracelets and a collar to offer ransom to the muffled visitor, then infers he is a Norman from his speech. Enters in outlaw clothes with his face concealed, rejects wealth and switches to French.",
