      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The prayer within",
      "description": "Leaves Rebecca and descends the turret stair when the horn summons him; his next room is not stated. Returns to the cell after Brian leaves and prays for herself, her father and the wounded Christian.",
