      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-28",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The chaplain’s materials",
      "description": "Agrees to draft an answer when supplies can be found. Orders Engelred to fetch the dead chaplain’s writing equipment. Reports Urfried keeps the materials and is sent to find them. Proposes recalling the Free Companions from York.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-new-hall",
