      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-28-p44",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-28",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Under the siege oak",
      "description": "Cannot interpret the French reply and passes it on. Shakes his head and passes the letter to Wamba. Makes a show of examining the corners before giving it to Locksley. Admits he cannot read its contents.",
