      "id": "ivanhoe-source-29-p15",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-29",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A useful messenger",
      "description": "Enters and privately advises that the stranger carry a written summons for De Bracy’s company. Agrees and has a domestic escort Wamba to the Saxon prisoners. Is allowed onward in his assumed clerical role.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-new-hall",
