      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-29-p43",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-29",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The rescue beyond",
      "description": "Explains the force outside, entrusts Gurth and Fangs to Cedric’s kindness and imagines his fool’s cap kept in remembrance. Is moved to tears and resolves to save the prisoners.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-old-hall",
