      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-29-p47",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-29",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Frock for cloak",
      "description": "Takes the friar’s costume, learns the Latin greeting and bids the two captives farewell. Receives Cedric’s cloak and girdle and coaches the escape. Remains behind, advising Cedric to accept any offered refreshment.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-old-hall",
