      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "An appeal in the passage",
      "description": "Tries the greeting, admits he does not understand Latin well and resists a plea to visit a wounded prisoner. Asks the apparent holy man to counsel the endangered patient.",
