      "id": "ivanhoe-source-29-p60",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-29",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Urfried intervenes",
      "description": "Interrupts, identifies Rebecca and orders her back to the sickroom while offering to guide Cedric. Uses the interruption to escape Rebecca’s request. Is dismissed to the wounded man rather than helped by the supposed priest.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-low-arched-passage",
