      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "To the sickroom",
      "description": "Returns to the care of Ivanhoe after being allowed out of the turret for that purpose. Is identified as the wounded prisoner entrusted to Rebecca’s nursing.",
