      "id": "ivanhoe-source-30-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A locked conversation",
      "description": "Secures a small room, recognises Saxon speech and insists on telling her history over wine. Admits Saxon birth but tries to decline priestly authority and leave.",
