      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Wolfganger’s daughter",
      "description": "Discloses her birth and recognises Cedric from his reference to his father. Identifies her father as Torquil Wolfganger, companion of his own father.",
