      "id": "ivanhoe-source-30-p14",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Ulrica named",
      "description": "Is identified as the woman the Saxons mourned as murdered and speaks of her revenge. Names Ulrica and condemns her survival under the conqueror.",
