      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The Baron at the door",
      "description": "Disappears through the private door before the Baron enters; her destination is not stated. Enters after Ulrica disappears, questions the supposed priest and threatens the Saxon convent. Bows in disguise, answers in hesitant French and suppresses his anger.",
