      "title": "The scroll for Malvoisin",
      "description": "Gives the disguised Cedric a scroll for Philip de Malvoisin to forward to York and orders him to hold the besiegers in place. Claims inability to read beyond memorised services and promises to keep the Saxons outside the walls.",
