      "id": "ivanhoe-source-30-p61",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A collar beneath the cap",
      "description": "Drinks wine and demands ransom from the supposed Cedric, then exposes the silver thrall collar. Keeps Cedric’s cap low but answers the threat in his own comic fashion. Is brought into the armoury with Wamba.",
