      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The escape discovered",
      "description": "Enters, recognises Wamba and deduces Cedric left in the frock. Realises he personally dismissed Cedric and threatens Wamba with mutilation and death. Faces the threat with a joke about becoming a cardinal.",
