      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A jester spared",
      "description": "Stops the killing, offers Wamba a place with the Free Companions and then turns to military defence. Conditions any new service on his master’s leave. Warns that the failed dispatch leaves an imminent assault.",
