      "id": "ivanhoe-source-30-p81",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The exclusions",
      "description": "Offers a thousand marks for the party, but refuses to abandon Rowena or Wamba. Accepts a ransom in principle while excluding Isaac and Wamba. Joins the group and excludes Rebecca. Insists Rowena is not included in the bargain.",
