      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A challenge refused",
      "description": "Renews his challenge and casts down a glove before being removed. Orders the glove hung on branched antlers until the prisoner is free. Reports Ambrose’s verified identity and is ordered to admit him.",
