      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-30",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The walls assigned",
      "description": "Looks out, recognises organised attack preparations and identifies the Black Knight. Sounds his bugle, assigns the eastern wall to De Bracy and western side to Brian, and orders Ambrose confined in the chapel. Notes the attackers’ disciplined use of cover. Continues the Prior’s errand until ordered out of the way.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-armoury-balcony",
