      "title": "The litter offered",
      "description": "Persuades Isaac to take the bleeding knight into her litter and gives up her own seat. Overcomes fear of blame and orders Seth and Reuben to carry him. Is unconscious after the collapse and requires careful transport. Is ordered to help bear the wounded knight. Shares the carrying order.",
