      "id": "ivanhoe-source-31-p60",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-31",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The guard relieved",
      "description": "Orders the squires to the barbican with crossbows and appoints Urfried to the sick man. Accepts charge of the patient and readily hands the nursing to Rebecca. Takes the nursing duty which she most wishes to perform. Remains the wounded patient while his custodians change.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-ivanhoe-room",
