      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A pulse and a question",
      "description": "Checks Ivanhoe’s health, is troubled by her unreturned affection and reports what little she knows. Recognises the captor’s voice and asks for the apparent priest’s help.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-ivanhoe-room",
