      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p8",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Steps to the lattice",
      "description": "Laments being weaponless and too weak to fight, then urges Rebecca to shield herself. Reports the failed errand, hears the preparations and climbs the few steps toward the window.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-ivanhoe-room",
