      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p38",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The axe at the breach",
      "description": "Describes the barrier breached, the Black Knight’s recovery from a fall, his broken sword and Front-de-Bœuf’s fall and removal. Asks who fell and follows the changing report anxiously.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-ivanhoe-window",
