      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p46",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The outwork taken",
      "description": "Reports fallen ladders, the Black Knight’s axe breaking the postern and the outwork captured. Urges attention to the tactical result and recognises exceptional strength.",
