      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p55",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The bridge destroyed",
      "description": "Reports Brian has destroyed the connecting plank and that the attackers shelter in the won outwork. Hears the account of the broken crossing, asks about the Black Knight’s marks and praises the attack.",
