      "id": "ivanhoe-source-32-p61",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Glory and its price",
      "description": "Leaves the window for the couch and questions the cost of chivalric glory. Defends battle, honour and chivalry as the restraints on tyranny.",
