      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-32",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A veil turned away",
      "description": "Reflects on her people and father, then wraps her veil and turns her back to the couch. Falls asleep from exhaustion during the temporary pause.",
