      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-33",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "After the first assault",
      "description": "Asks Brian where Front-de-Bœuf is, saying men report that he has been slain. Meets De Bracy in the hall during the pause after the attackers’ first success.",
