      "id": "ivanhoe-source-33-p5",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-33",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The Baron still lives",
      "description": "Reports Front-de-Bœuf alive but gravely wounded and rejects De Bracy’s religious explanation of the reverse. Attributes the Baron’s fate to his irreverence and challenges Brian’s own beliefs.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-new-hall",
