      "id": "ivanhoe-source-33-p10",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-33",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "No composition",
      "description": "Suggests releasing prisoners to end the siege, then agrees to renew the defence. Refuses a surrender that would expose the abduction and shame their knightly reputation.",
