      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-33",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A voice by the bed",
      "description": "Mistakes the reproaching voice for a demon and tries to excuse his violence and rebellion. Accuses him of murders and his father’s death before becoming visible.",
