      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-33",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The fuel below",
      "description": "Reveals she has kindled the fuel stored beneath the apartments and promises the attack signal. Recognises the rising smoke and fire around his sickbed.",
