      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-source-34-p0",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-34",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The first plan recalled",
      "description": "Reports Ulrica’s promised signal and refuses command of a siege he has not studied. Takes direction of the archers. Offers to lead the assault. Pledges his help for Wamba.",
