      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The fire warning",
      "description": "Runs onto the planks to warn Cedric of the stone above him. Tells De Bracy the west side is burning and proposes a two-sided escape. Abandons the lever to gather men for the proposed sally.",
