      "id": "ivanhoe-source-34-p57",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-34",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Taken from the chamber",
      "description": "Enters damaged and bloodied, refuses to rescue the other captives and carries Rebecca away by force. Rejects safety without Isaac and Ivanhoe and cries out when seized. Denounces Brian but cannot prevent the abduction.",
