      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The knight carried out",
      "description": "Finds Ivanhoe by his shouts, carries him to the postern and gives him to two yeomen before returning inside. Asks his rescuer to aid Rowena and Cedric rather than himself.",
