      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Rowena found",
      "description": "Finds Rowena and entrusts her to Gurth, then turns to seek Athelstane. Protects Cedric through the fighting and undertakes Rowena’s escort to the barbican. Has waited with a crucifix expecting death and is now led to safety.",
