      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A clamour in the hall",
      "description": "Sits mounted in the court among the remaining defenders after ordering the drawbridge lowered for their escape. Bangs rusty armour and shouts a false victory cry, frightening the guard into leaving the door open. Escapes with Wamba through the anteroom to the court.",
