      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A mistaken rescue",
      "description": "Protects Rebecca with his shield while rallying the mounted escape party. Is held on horseback before one of Brian’s attendants. Mistakes Rebecca for Rowena and resolves to attack. Recognises the dark hair and tries to restrain Athelstane.",
