      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-34",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The Templar’s retreat",
      "description": "Breaks through the main drawbridge with his mounted party, offers to rescue De Bracy and announces Templestowe as destination. Refuses rescue because of his surrendered word and warns Brian to leave England. Is carried away with the Templar’s party. Follows Brian on horseback with Abdalla through the drawbridge under arrows and round toward the barbican. Follows Brian on horseback with Hamet through the drawbridge under arrows and round toward the barbican.",
