      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "No share for Cedric",
      "description": "Reports Athelstane dead, refuses booty and prepares escorts for Rowena and the supposed body. Accepts Cedric’s refusal of a portion for his followers. Hints that some followers have already helped themselves.",
