      "id": "ivanhoe-source-36-p50",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-36",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "News of Rebecca",
      "description": "Recognises the archer’s description of Rebecca, hears she was carried off by the Templar and laments her danger. Asks whether payment of the full ransom would leave Isaac without money to help his daughter.",
