      "id": "ivanhoe-source-36-p56",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-36",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Money for a ransom",
      "description": "Reduces the ransom from his own share and reports that scouts place Brian at the next Preceptory. Gains hope that Rebecca is alive and might be ransomed, then kneels in gratitude before the captain.",
