      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The Prior’s influence",
      "description": "Offers his influence with Brian in exchange for a benefit and uses scripture to justify taking Isaac’s money. Grieves that each appeal exposes him to another demand. Hears the Prior’s proposal before taking Isaac aside.",
