      "title": "The survivor’s news",
      "description": "Arrives in battered armour, sets down his helmet and reports Brian’s flight and Front-de-Boeuf’s death. Questions whether the Saxons have risen in rebellion. Asks after the Templar and Front-de-Boeuf and hears the news of the fire.",
