      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The folded scrap",
      "description": "Moves through the crowd toward her appointed seat, receives an unread scrap of paper and takes courage from having an unknown friend. Accompanies Rebecca through the crowded lower hall toward the appointed seat. Moves with the escorted prisoner and the Preceptor as the crowd makes way.",
