      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The court assembled",
      "description": "Faces the elevated tribunal. Presides above the scribes and four preceptors. Leaves his assigned seat and traces lines on the floor with his sheathed sword. Sits among the preceptors. Attends the tribunal and hears the Grand Master’s private interpretation of Brian’s marks.",
