      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Banishment instead of death",
      "description": "Spares Fitzurse under conditions of exile and silence and orders a horse supplied. Receives his life under the king’s conditions. Objects to the pardon but accepts the command to provide a captured horse.",
