      "title": "A revel prolonged",
      "description": "Joins the outlaws’ feast. Confers privately with Ivanhoe and orders Scathlock to sound a false alarm. Agrees that the king must be persuaded to leave. Is sent behind a thicket to sound a Norman call.",
