      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The manufactured alarm",
      "description": "Sounds the ordered bugle from concealment. Mistakes the call for Malvoisin’s and takes his bow. Drops his flagon for his staff. Takes sword and target. Helps Richard put on the heavy armour laid aside during the feast. Prepares to fight and orders Ivanhoe to remain out of danger. Asks pardon after breaking up the gathering.",
