      "id": "ivanhoe-source-46-p34",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-46",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The procession",
      "description": "Rides behind the preceptors through the opened gate and across the lowered drawbridge. Rides in bright armour behind the Master while his two esquires carry his lance, shield and sword. Rides on one side of Brian as a godfather of the champion. Rides on the other side of the champion in the Order’s white dress. Walks under the warders’ escort behind the mounted party, wearing a coarse white dress with her ornaments removed.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-templestowe-procession-route",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
        "ivanhoe-character-beaumanoir",
