      "id": "ivanhoe-source-46-p37",
      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-46",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "Within the enclosure",
      "description": "Completes the circuit of the lists and dismounts while an esquire removes his horse. Remains mounted as champion when the procession halts after its circuit. Stays mounted beside the champion in his role as godfather after the circuit. Keeps his saddle as one of the two godfathers while the other attendants dismount. Enters the lists with her escort, makes the circuit on foot and halts with the procession.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-templestowe-lists",
      "involvedCharacterIds": [
