      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-46",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The pledge laid down",
      "description": "Is seated near the prepared pile. Takes his seat and orders the challenge proclaimed. Lays Rebecca’s glove at the Grand Master’s feet and falsely claims the requisite oath was already sworn. Waits as the Order’s champion. Is named in Albert’s fabricated oath account.",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-templestowe-lists",
