      "description": "Approaches Rebecca’s chair, takes Brian’s bridle, then speaks aside to Conrade after Brian returns to his station. Shakes off Albert’s hand and rides back to the upper end of the lists. Receives Albert’s aside about Brian’s dangerous remaining spirit.",
