      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "A champion arrives",
      "description": "Rides into the enclosure exhausted on a spent horse and declares that he will defend Rebecca, without yet giving his name. Asks the stranger his rank, name and purpose. Insists that the unknown challenger establish his honourable lineage.",
