      "chapterId": "ivanhoe-section-46",
      "timelineId": "ivanhoe-reading-order",
      "title": "The former gage recalled",
      "description": "Claims the Rotherwood reliquary pledge as his own, demands combat and asks Rebecca to accept him. Accepts the provoked challenge. Permits combat subject to Rebecca’s acceptance. Accepts Ivanhoe but fears for his unhealed wounds.",
