      "description": "Marries Rowena at York Minster with the king and his household attending. Becomes Ivanhoe’s wife in the Minster ceremony approved by Cedric. Attends Rowena and Ivanhoe’s marriage in York Minster. Serves as the bridegroom’s esquire in fine clothing. Attends with a new cap and silver bells.",
