      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-32-p17",
      "sortKey": 32.000332,
      "status": "active",
      "notes": "From the corner window Rebecca sees the moat separating the outwork from the main fortress and the temporary bridge connecting them."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-location-state-torquilstone-postern-crossing-ivanhoe-source-32-p55",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-postern-crossing",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-32-p55",
      "sortKey": 32.000337,
      "status": "destroyed",
      "notes": "Rebecca reports that the Templar destroyed the connecting plank during the retreat. The moat now separates the won outwork from the castle."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-location-state-torquilstone-postern-crossing-ivanhoe-source-34-p13",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-postern-crossing",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-34-p13",
      "sortKey": 34.00035,
      "status": "destroyed",
      "notes": "A new floating bridge has been constructed during the pause. The Black Knight orders it launched; the gap has not yet been crossed."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-location-state-torquilstone-postern-crossing-ivanhoe-source-34-p20",
      "locationMarkerId": "ivanhoe-place-torquilstone-postern-crossing",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-34-p20",
      "sortKey": 34.000351,
      "status": "rebuilt",
      "notes": "The long raft is thrust across the moat. The Black Knight and Cedric cross its slippery two-abreast surface; followers retreat under missiles."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-location-state-torquilstone-main-postern-ivanhoe-source-34-p20",
