      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-34-p20",
      "sortKey": 34.000351,
      "status": "sieged",
      "notes": "The two attackers have reached the castle side of the moat; the Black Knight strikes the closed gate with his axe."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
