      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p17",
      "sortKey": 14.000125,
      "condition": "intact",
      "notes": "Rebecca’s silk purse is enclosed within the seized leather pouch."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-item-gurth-coins-state-ivanhoe-source-14-p17",
      "itemId": "ivanhoe-item-gurth-coins",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p17",
      "sortKey": 14.000125,
      "condition": "intact",
      "notes": "The personal coins are not separately located during seizure of the larger pouch; do not assume an unreported second purse remains securely with Gurth."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-item-masters-gold-state-ivanhoe-source-14-p41",
      "itemId": "ivanhoe-item-masters-gold",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p41",
      "sortKey": 14.000127,
      "condition": "intact",
      "notes": "Gurth nearly recovers the pouch after striking the captain, but the thieves secure it again. His attempted recovery does not restore custody."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-item-rebecca-purse-state-ivanhoe-source-14-p41",
      "itemId": "ivanhoe-item-rebecca-purse",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p41",
      "sortKey": 14.000127,
      "condition": "intact",
      "notes": "The silk purse remains with the recaptured bag; Gurth’s dash has failed."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-item-masters-gold-state-ivanhoe-source-14-p55",
      "itemId": "ivanhoe-item-masters-gold",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p55",
      "sortKey": 14.000129,
      "condition": "intact",
      "notes": "The robbers pronounce Gurth and his purse safe and release him with guides. Restoration is implied by his intact release; no separate hand-to-hand return is described."
    },
    {
      "worldId": "ivanhoe-world",
      "createdAt": 1793232000000,
      "updatedAt": 1793232000000,
      "id": "ivanhoe-item-rebecca-purse-state-ivanhoe-source-14-p55",
      "itemId": "ivanhoe-item-rebecca-purse",
      "eventId": "ivanhoe-source-14-p55",
